This file tells Git to ignore these files and folders.

Node.js dependencies

These folders are huge and everyone downloads their own.

/node_modules
/app/node_modules
/functions/node_modules

Firebase

These files are specific to your local setup or contain logs.

.firebase
*.log
firebase-debug.log

React Native / Expo

These are local build folders and user-specific settings.

.expo/
/android/
/ios/

Operating System files

.DS_Store
Thumbs.db